            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Geomagnetism and Paleomagnetism: Time variations, paleomagnetism; Tectonophysics: Plate tectonics; Information Related to Geologic Time: Paleozoic; Information Related to Geographic Region: North America</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Paleomagnetism of the Devonian Catskill red beds: Evidence for motion of the coastal New England-Canadian maritime region relative to cratonic North America</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
